        "properties": {
          "modelTiers": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "THE single normative source for how much reasoning each agent gets. Keyed by agent id; every active agent needs an entry. `economy` is a cheap fast model for high-volume recon and hygiene; `standard` inherits the provider default. scripts/agent-system/generate-adapters.mjs DERIVES each provider's own spelling from this (claude haiku/inherit, antigravity flash/inherit) and REFUSES a `model` authored in agents.json providerConfig — two places to set the cost of an agent is two places to set it differently. Bound to route risk by check-graph invariant 14: an R3/R4 route may not reach an economy-tier agent. Until 2026-09-03 this map was schema-valid, unconstrained, and read by no code at all; `economy` appeared nowhere else in the repository.",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "enum": [
